  "description": "Grandeur Oud Elixir is a rich, smoky-woody, and resinous fragrance built for those who love deep Middle Eastern oud blends with modern elegance. It opens with smoky oud, warm spices, and resinous warmth, creating a bold, luxurious first impression. In the heart, amber, incense, and dark woods emerge, adding complexity and depth while keeping the scent smooth and refined. The base settles into suede, musk, precious woods, and a lingering smoky-woody-amber resonance, delivering a long-lasting, powerful trail ideal for evening wear or special occasions. This scent is perfect for customers who enjoy smoky oud-based fragrances, strong projection, and an elegant, timeless Middle-Eastern character.",
